pi-zed adapts code and functionality from the Zed integration and shared core in
pi-agent-status by yuki-kisaku:
https://github.com/yuki-kisaku/pi-agent-status

Upstream-derived functionality in pi-zed includes:
- Detecting Zed terminals and standing down inside tmux.
- Showing a configurable spinner in the terminal title while Pi is working.
- Ringing the terminal bell when the agent finishes.
- Generating AI session titles and supporting /rename to regenerate or set a title explicitly.
- Interactive settings for the spinner, completion bell, and title generation/model.
- Shared title, spinner, completion-alert, and settings implementation code.

This fork adds the editable maximum-title-length setting and safer handling of long titles.

